    "detailed_description": "Mischief On Main Street is an online multiplayer VR game inspired by the likes of Mafia and Trouble In Terrorist Town.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLie and bluff your way to victory with 5-12 other players. Discover traitors or stealthily take out innocents to earn points, then see who has the top score after multiple rounds of deceitful competition! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMischief On Main Street delivers organic fun and laughs like only a social VR experience can, so put your best poker face on and hop in!",
